          "lang_word": "drought",
          "definition": "n. 乾旱；長期缺乏"
        }
      ],
      "examples": [
        {
          "en": "The severe drought destroyed nearly half of the region's wheat crop this year.",
          "highlight": [
            "drought"
          ],
          "translations": {
            "zh-TW": "嚴重的乾旱今年摧毁了該區將近一半的小麥收成。"
