          "en": "Climate experts warn that prolonged droughts will become more frequent in the coming decades.",
          "highlight": [
            "droughts"
          ],
          "translations": {
            "zh-TW": "氣候專家警告，未來數十年長期乾旱將變得更加頻繁。"
          }
        },
        {
          "en": "Water rationing was introduced after the drought entered its third month.",
          "highlight": [
            "drought"
          ],
          "translations": {
            "zh-TW": "在乾旱進入第三個月後，當局開始實施限水措施。"
          }
        }
